  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>lnf</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Add all the equations&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>205</mn><mn>144</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
